// Title: Invoke-Obfuscation RUNDLL LAUNCHER - Security
// ID: f241cf1b-3a6b-4e1a-b4f9-133c00dd95ca
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Timur Zinniatullin, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-18
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
// Description: Detects Obfuscated Powershell via RUNDLL LAUNCHER
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(where(EventID = "4697") AND (where(ServiceFileName ICONTAINS "rundll32.exe") AND where(ServiceFileName ICONTAINS "shell32.dll") AND where(ServiceFileName ICONTAINS "shellexec_rundll") AND where(ServiceFileName ICONTAINS "powershell")))
